<title>BELGIUM: UCB current profits up 33 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>UCB current profits up 33 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results for year to December 31, 1996. (figures in billions of Belgian franks)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   5.840     vs    3.397</p>
<p>    Turnover			  50.825     vs   51.738</p>
<p>    Cash flow			 11.994     vs    6.624</p>
<p>    Depreciation		     2.599     vs    2.889</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		1.257     vs    0.010</p>
<p>    Taxation			  -1.043     vs   -0.829</p>
<p>NOTE: Chemicals and drugs firm UCB said the board decided to propose to the annual general meeting on June 10 to pay a net dividend of 750 francs per share against 600 last year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
